"present", "pronoun": "hunna", "arabic": "يُعْرِضْنَ", "plain": "يُعْرِضْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/b404fa344b8eb385f7fc.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "arabic": "أَعْرِضْ", "plain": "أَعْرِضْ", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/db999a3e2b18ea375d22.m4a", "recited": "audio/a287f5f2cd15175c391b.m4a", "recitedText": "أَعْرِضْ"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "أَعْرِضِي", "plain": "أَعْرِضِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/3e23ed2be44e0bf1e876.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "أَعْرِضَا", "plain": "أَعْرِضَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/6f583d848719ea95e7ac.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "أَعْرِضُوا۟", "plain": "أَعْرِضُوا", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/7fe962be7ec6e4805647.m4a", "recited": "audio/016ce7245cdef92bd188.m4a", "recitedText": "فَأَعْرِضُوا۟"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "أَعْرِضْنَ", "plain": "أَعْرِضْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/02fd6c3de08950f1541a.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "32:30", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3533.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "So withdraw from them (O Muhammad), and await (the event). Lo! they (also) are awaiting (it).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Şimdi sen onlardan yüz çevir de gözet. Çünkü onlar da gözetmektedirler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو ان سے منہ پھیرلو اور انتظار کرو بیشک انہیں بھی انتظار کرنا ہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka berpalinglah kamu dari mereka dan tunggulah, sesungguhnya mereka (juga) menunggu.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَأَعْرِضْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/c196be980229b39d15b4.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa se okreni", "en": "so turn away", "tr": "öyleyse yüz çevir", "fr": "détourne-toi donc", "id": "maka berpalinglah", "ur": "پس منہ پھیر لو", "bn": "অতএব মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও", "fa": "پس روی بگردان"}}, {"text": "عَنْهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱنتَظِرْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّنتَظِرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "41:4", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4222.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Good tidings and a warning. But most of them turn away so that they hear not.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O, müjdeleyici ve uyarıcı olarak gönderilmiştir. Fakat insanların çoğu yüz çevirmişlerdir. Artık onlar gerçeği işitmezler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "خوشخبری دیتا اور ڈر سناتا تو ان میں اکثر نے منہ پھیرا تو وہ سنتے ہی نہیں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "yang membawa berita gembira dan yang membawa peringatan, tetapi kebanyakan mereka berpaling, tidak mau mendengarkan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "بَشِيرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَنَذِيرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَأَعْرَضَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/5dbcaea7d42610bdcdaa.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa su se okrenuli", "en": "but turned away", "tr": "ama yüz çevirdiler", "fr": "mais il s'est détourné", "id": "tetapi berpaling", "ur": "مگر منہ پھیر لیا", "bn": "কিন্তু সে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিল", "fa": "اما روی گرداند"}}, {"text": "أَكْثَرُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَسْمَعُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "41:13", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4231.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "But if they turn away, then say: I warn you of a thunderbolt like the thunderbolt (which fell of old upon the tribes) of A'ad and Thamud;", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Eğer onlar, yine yüz çevirirlerse de ki: \"Ben sizi Âd ve Semud'un başına gelen yıldırıma benzer bir yıldırıma karşı uyardım.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "پھر اگر وہ منہ پھیریں تو تم فرماؤ کہ میں تمہیں ڈراتا ہوں ایک کڑ ک سے جیسی کڑ ک عاد اور ثمود پر آئی تھی", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Jika mereka berpaling maka katakanlah: \"Aku telah memperingatkan kamu dengan petir, seperti petir yang menimpa kaum 'Aad dan Tsamud\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَإِنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَعْرَضُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/dfc61f2dd1e526c1d3f9.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they turned away", "bs": "okrenuli su se", "tr": "yüz çevirdiler", "fr": "ils se sont détournés", "id": "mereka telah berpaling", "ur": "انہوں نے منہ موڑا", "bn": "তারা মুখ ফেরাল", "fa": "روی گرداندند"}}, {"text": "فَقُلْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنذَرْتُكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَٰعِقَةً", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّثْلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَٰعِقَةِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَادٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَثَمُودَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "17:28", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2057.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "But if thou turn away from them, seeking mercy from thy Lord, for which thou hopest, then speak unto them a reasonable word.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Eğer Rabbinden beklediğin bir rahmet (rızık) için, onlardan yüz çevirmek mecburiyetinde kalırsan, o vakit de onlara yumuşak ve tatlı bir söz söyle.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اگر تو ان سے منہ پھیرے اپنے رب کی رحمت کے انتظار میں جس کی تجھے امید ہے تو ان سے آسان بات کہہ", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan jika kamu berpaling dari mereka untuk memperoleh rahmat dari Tuhanmu yang kamu harapkan, maka katakanlah kepada mereka ucapan yang pantas.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَإِمَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُعْرِضَنَّ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/9508a0c5e3c126b514a3.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}]}, {"text": "عَنْهُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱبْتِغَآءَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَحْمَةٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَّبِّكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَرْجُوهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَقُل", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَّهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَوْلًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّيْسُورًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "54:2", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4848.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And if they behold a portent they turn away and say: Prolonged illusion.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bir mucize görseler hemen yüz çevirirler ve \"süregelen bir büyüdür\" derler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اگر دیکھیں کوئی نشانی تو منہ پھیرتے اور کہتے ہیں یہ تو جادو ہے چلا آتا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan jika mereka (orang-orang musyrikin) melihat suatu tanda (mukjizat), mereka berpaling dan berkata: \"(Ini adalah) sihir yang terus menerus\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَإِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَرَوْا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَايَةً", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُعْرِضُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/f07a226f71f6d3d46628.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "okreću se", "en": "they turn away", "tr": "yüz çevirirler", "fr": "ils se détournent", "id": "mereka berpaling", "ur": "وہ منہ پھیرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়", "fa": "روی می‌گردانند"}}, {"text": "وَيَقُولُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سِحْرٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّسْتَمِرٌّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "72:17", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5464.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "That We may test them thereby, and whoso turneth away from the remembrance of his Lord; He will thrust him into ever-growing torment.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ki onları onunla sınayalım. Kim Rabbini anmaktan yüz çevirirse, Rabbi onu gittikçe yükselen bir azaba sokar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہ اس پر انہیں جانچیں اور جو اپنے رب کی یاد سے منہ پھیرے وہ اسے چڑھتے عذاب میں ڈالے گا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Untuk Kami beri cobaan kepada mereka padanya. Dan barangsiapa yang berpaling dari peringatan Tuhannya, niscaya akan dimasukkan-Nya ke dalam azab yang amat berat.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لِّنَفْتِنَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُعْرِضْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a2d809f21b64387a1dec.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it turns away", "bs": "okreće se", "tr": "yüz çevirir", "fr": "il se détourne", "id": "dia berpaling", "ur": "وہ منہ موڑتا ہے", "bn": "সে মুখ ফেরায়", "fa": "روی بگرداند"}}, {"text": "عَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ذِكْرِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبِّهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَسْلُكْهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَذَابًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَعَدًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "فَأَعْرِضْ", "count": 5, "first": "4:63", "audio": "audio/76c9ec6f093af680a600.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "pa se okreni", "en": "so turn away", "tr": "öyleyse yüz çevir", "fr": "détourne-toi donc", "id": "maka berpalinglah", "ur": "پس منہ پھیر لو", "bn": "অতএব মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও", "fa": "پس روی بگردان"}}, {"arabic": "أَعْرَضَ", "count": 5, "first": "17:83", "audio": "audio/9f5758376dddd58e7027.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it turned away", "bs": "okrenuo se", "tr": "yüz çevirdi", "fr": "il s'est détourné", "id": "dia telah berpaling", "ur": "اُس نے منہ موڑا", "bn": "সে মুখ ফেরাল", "fa": "روی گرداند"}}, {"arabic": "أَعْرِضْ", "count": 3, "first": "5:42", "audio": "audio/a287f5f2cd15175c391b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "turn away!", "bs": "okreni se!", "tr": "yüz çevir!", "fr": "détourne-toi !", "id": "berpalinglah!", "ur": "منہ موڑ!", "bn": "মুখ ফেরাও!", "fa": "روی بگردان!"}}, {"arabic": "وَأَعْرِضْ", "count": 3, "first": "6:106", "audio": "audio/2de7351c8fa139fb1b70.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and turn away!", "bs": "i okreni se!", "tr": "ve yüz çevir!", "fr": "et détourne-toi !", "id": "dan berpalinglah!", "ur": "اور منہ موڑ!", "bn": "এবং মুখ ফেরাও!", "fa": "و روی بگردان!"}}, {"arabic": "أَعْرَضُوا۟", "count": 3, "first": "28:55", "audio": "audio/9eff75815f45abc1b5fd.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "they turned away", "bs": "okrenuli su se", "tr": "yüz çevirdiler", "fr": "ils se sont détournés", "id": "mereka telah berpaling", "ur": "انہوں نے منہ موڑا", "bn": "তারা মুখ ফেরাল", "fa": "روی گرداندند"}}, {"arabic": "فَأَعْرِضُوا۟", "count": 2, "first": "4:16", "audio": "audio/016ce7245cdef92bd188.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "so (you all) turn away!", "bs": "pa se okrenite!", "tr": "böylece yüz çevirin!", "fr": "alors détournez-vous !", "id": "maka berpalinglah kalian!", "ur": "پس تم سب منہ موڑو!", "bn": "অতএব তোমরা মুখ ফেরাও!", "fa": "پس روی بگردانید!"}}, {"arabic": "فَأَعْرَضَ", "count": 2, "first": "18:57", "audio": "audio/f956e1399993e463fa41.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "pa su se okrenuli", "en": "but turned away", "tr": "ama yüz çevirdiler", "fr": "mais il s'est détourné", "id": "tetapi berpaling", "ur": "مگر منہ پھیر لیا", "bn": "কিন্তু সে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিল", "fa": "اما روی گرداند"}}, {"arabic": "تُعْرِضُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "4:135", "audio": "audio/bafe7b2334c45085e994.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) turn away", "bs": "okrećete se", "tr": "yüz çevirirsiniz", "fr": "vous vous détournez", "id": "kalian berpaling", "ur": "تم منہ موڑتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা মুখ ফেরাও", "fa": "روی بگردانید"}}, {"arabic": "تُعْرِضْ", "count": 1, "first": "5:42", "audio": "audio/c9c818bd340e8d168126.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"arabic": "لِتُعْرِضُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "9:95", "audio": "audio/093b0944dd99a6ad0980.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "so that you (all) may turn away", "bs": "da se okrenete", "tr": "yüz çeviresiniz diye", "fr": "que vous vous détourniez", "id": "agar kalian berpaling", "ur": "تاکہ تم منہ موڑو", "bn": "যাতে তোমরা মুখ ফেরাও", "fa": "تا روی بگردانید"}}, {"arabic": "تُعْرِضَنَّ", "count": 1, "first": "17:28", "audio": "audio/9508a0c5e3c126b514a3.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}]}, {"arabic": "أَعْرَضْتُمْ", "count": 1, "first": "17:67", "audio": "audio/19985062330b00454277.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) turned away", "bs": "okrenuli ste se", "tr": "yüz çevirdiniz", "fr": "vous vous êtes détournés", "id": "kalian telah berpaling", "ur": "تم نے منہ موڑا", "bn": "তোমরা মুখ ফিরিয়েছিলে", "fa": "روی گرداندید"}}, {"arabic": "فَأَعْرَضُوا۟", "count": 1, "fir